     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello all,<div><br></div><div>I would like to plot a heatmap with a tree. However I don&#39;t want a heatmap with a continuous scale, but one where all the data are already within an interval and coloured as such. I can produce the datamatrix with geom_tile, but am not able to plot it along the tree. Any help would very much be appreciated. I add a test file, my code until now and the tree file. I hope that any one can help me?</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you,</div><div><br></div><div>Setareh</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
